  "notes": "{延期|えんき} means postponement — putting off a planned event or deadline to a later date. A compound of {延|えん} (extend) + {期|き} (period).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{延期|えんき}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {延期|えんき}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to postpone\n- {延期|えんき}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧: to be postponed\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{延期|えんき}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to postpone to (a date)\n- {延期|えんき}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{決|き}める→決める：00858_kimeru⟧: to decide on a postponement\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{中止|ちゅうし}→中止：03481_chuushi⟧: cancellation (not postponed, but cancelled entirely)\n- ⟦{順延|じゅんえん}→順延：15354_junen⟧: postponement to the next available day (especially for outdoor events due to rain)\n- ⟦{先送|さきおく}り→先送り：08030_sakiokuri⟧: putting off, deferring (often implies avoidance)\n\nUSAGE:\nCommon for meetings, events, sports games, and deadlines. ⟦{雨天|うてん}→雨天：15325_uten⟧{延期|えんき} (postponed due to rain) is a set phrase.",
